{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15119","headline":"送诸曁王主簿之任 · 李益","name":"送诸曁王主簿之任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别愁已万绪，离曲方三奏。\n远宦一辞乡，南天异风候。\n秦城岁芳老，越国春山秀。\n落日望寒涛，公门闭清昼。\n何用慰相思，裁书寄关右。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15119.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15119","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}